[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "localized_name": "ヤンネ",
    "romanized_name": "Janne",
    "model_path_hash": 2318022885960174855,
    "text": "みんな、いい調子よ。\nそのまま速度を落とさず続けて！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3552163027021623318,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "localized_name": "アルビーナ",
    "romanized_name": "Alvina",
    "model_path_hash": 8589968507503775476,
    "text": "こ、これ、運動後の柔軟とは、わけが違うって……！\nぐぅ……ぐるじい……",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 8874763601186801212,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "localized_name": "ヤンネ",
    "romanized_name": "Janne",
    "model_path_hash": 2318022885960174855,
    "text": "アルビーナ、もう音を上げるの？\nあなたの覚悟はそんなものなの？　違うでしょう！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3552163027021623318,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "localized_name": "ヤンネ",
    "romanized_name": "Janne",
    "model_path_hash": 2318022885960174855,
    "text": "もっと熱くなるのよ、アルビーナ！！\nあなたの覚悟を見せてちょうだい！！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3552163027021623318,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "localized_name": "ベップ",
    "romanized_name": "Bepp",
    "model_path_hash": 2719129412126717307,
    "text": "姉様ならできるわ！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 4522117749578412567,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "localized_name": "アルビーナ",
    "romanized_name": "Alvina",
    "model_path_hash": 8589968507503775476,
    "text": "くぅ～……っ！！　やったるわーい！！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 8874763601186801212,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "localized_name": "レスナ",
    "romanized_name": "Resna",
    "model_path_hash": 8632999372503809361,
    "text": "うぅ……も、もう無理かも……",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3591455468400854031,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "localized_name": "ヤンネ",
    "romanized_name": "Janne",
    "model_path_hash": 2318022885960174855,
    "text": "レスナちゃん、初めてなのに頑張っているわね。\nもちろん無理はしちゃダメだけど……",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3552163027021623318,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "localized_name": "ヤンネ",
    "romanized_name": "Janne",
    "model_path_hash": 2318022885960174855,
    "text": "この鍛錬は腕の筋肉が鍛えられるから、\n錬金釜をかき混ぜる力も育つはずよ",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3552163027021623318,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "localized_name": "レスナ",
    "romanized_name": "Resna",
    "model_path_hash": 8632999372503809361,
    "text": "錬金術に活きるんですね……！！\nま、まだまだ、頑張ります……っ！！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3591455468400854031,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "localized_name": "イザナ",
    "romanized_name": "Izana",
    "model_path_hash": 2294695844032883758,
    "text": "さっすがレスナちゃん！\nアタシも騎士として、負けられない！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 7010833269667927555,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "localized_name": "アルビーナ",
    "romanized_name": "Alvina",
    "model_path_hash": 8589968507503775476,
    "text": "ヤンネさん！？\nアタシとレスナでなんか扱い違くない！？",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 8874763601186801212,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "localized_name": "ヤンネ",
    "romanized_name": "Janne",
    "model_path_hash": 2318022885960174855,
    "text": "こらアルビーナ、止まってるわよ！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3552163027021623318,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "localized_name": "アルビーナ",
    "romanized_name": "Alvina",
    "model_path_hash": 8589968507503775476,
    "text": "うわーん！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 8874763601186801212,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "localized_name": "ヤンネ",
    "romanized_name": "Janne",
    "model_path_hash": 2318022885960174855,
    "text": "さ、これが終わったら次は走り込みよ。\nその後は少しの休憩を挟んで――",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3552163027021623318,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "localized_name": "ヨハナ",
    "romanized_name": "Johanna",
    "model_path_hash": 6763523268261092223,
    "text": "ちょ、どんだけやらせる気なの……！？",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 5625633481186064994,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "localized_name": "ヤンネ",
    "romanized_name": "Janne",
    "model_path_hash": 2318022885960174855,
    "text": "今日はここまでにしましょうか。\nみんな、お疲れさま",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3552163027021623318,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "localized_name": "ベップ",
    "romanized_name": "Bepp",
    "model_path_hash": 2719129412126717307,
    "text": "お疲れさまでした",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 4522117749578412567,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "localized_name": "アルビーナ",
    "romanized_name": "Alvina",
    "model_path_hash": 8589968507503775476,
    "text": "お、お疲れさまでしたぁ……",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 8874763601186801212,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "localized_name": "ヤンネ",
    "romanized_name": "Janne",
    "model_path_hash": 2318022885960174855,
    "text": "ふふ、いい鍛錬になったわね。\nいつもと違う環境でやりがいがあったわ",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3552163027021623318,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "localized_name": "ヤンネ",
    "romanized_name": "Janne",
    "model_path_hash": 2318022885960174855,
    "text": "明日もみんなでやりましょっか。\n遊びに行く前に",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3552163027021623318,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "localized_name": "アルビーナ",
    "romanized_name": "Alvina",
    "model_path_hash": 8589968507503775476,
    "text": "げっ！　明日も！？",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 8874763601186801212,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "localized_name": "ヤンネ",
    "romanized_name": "Janne",
    "model_path_hash": 2318022885960174855,
    "text": "ええ。明日も明後日も。\nケガしないように、準備運動を兼ねてね",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3552163027021623318,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "localized_name": "ヤンネ",
    "romanized_name": "Janne",
    "model_path_hash": 2318022885960174855,
    "text": "あら、あそこにいる子、困ってるみたい。\nちょっと見てくるわ",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3552163027021623318,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "localized_name": "アルビーナ",
    "romanized_name": "Alvina",
    "model_path_hash": 8589968507503775476,
    "text": "……こんな鍛錬、毎日続けられたら、\n疲れちゃって遊ぶどころじゃないよ！！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 8874763601186801212,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "localized_name": "ヴァレリア",
    "romanized_name": "Valeria",
    "model_path_hash": 7203201562534310700,
    "text": "やっほー二人とも。ヤドヴィガ見かけてない？\n……って、なんかあった？",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 491776654605821708,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "localized_name": "キューン",
    "romanized_name": "Quinn",
    "model_path_hash": 913274709521753211,
    "text": "なんだかすっごく疲れてる……？",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 7374237645965483172,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "localized_name": "アルビーナ",
    "romanized_name": "Alvina",
    "model_path_hash": 8589968507503775476,
    "text": "あー、うん。実は――",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 8874763601186801212,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "localized_name": "アルビーナ",
    "romanized_name": "Alvina",
    "model_path_hash": 8589968507503775476,
    "text": "ってことで、ヤンネさんの鍛錬を止めないと\nアタシたちの楽しい休暇が存続の危機に！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 8874763601186801212,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "localized_name": "キューン",
    "romanized_name": "Quinn",
    "model_path_hash": 913274709521753211,
    "text": "うーんと……それなら何か理由を付けて\n鍛錬に参加しなければいいんじゃないかな……？",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 7374237645965483172,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "localized_name": "アルビーナ",
    "romanized_name": "Alvina",
    "model_path_hash": 8589968507503775476,
    "text": "うーん、そうなんだけど～、\nアタシはヤンネさんとも一緒に遊びたいの！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 8874763601186801212,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "localized_name": "ベップ",
    "romanized_name": "Bepp",
    "model_path_hash": 2719129412126717307,
    "text": "ええ。こういう休暇は初めてだって言ってたから、\nみんなでいい思い出にしたい",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 4522117749578412567,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "localized_name": "アルビーナ",
    "romanized_name": "Alvina",
    "model_path_hash": 8589968507503775476,
    "text": "もちろん、毎日の鍛錬が大切なのも分かるけどさ。\nせっかくの水着と行楽地、楽しんでほしいじゃん……！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 8874763601186801212,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "localized_name": "ヴァレリア",
    "romanized_name": "Valeria",
    "model_path_hash": 7203201562534310700,
    "text": "……それなら、鍛錬よりもやりたくなるような、\nすっごく楽しい何かを用意してみるとかは？",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 491776654605821708,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "localized_name": "ベップ",
    "romanized_name": "Bepp",
    "model_path_hash": 2719129412126717307,
    "text": "たとえば？",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 4522117749578412567,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "localized_name": "ヴァレリア",
    "romanized_name": "Valeria",
    "model_path_hash": 7203201562534310700,
    "text": "それは、分からないけど――",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 491776654605821708,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "localized_name": "ヴァレリア",
    "romanized_name": "Valeria",
    "model_path_hash": 7203201562534310700,
    "text": "すっごく楽しそうなことがあれば、\n鍛錬なんてそっちのけよ！　多分！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 491776654605821708,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  }
]